REGENT OF BUTON
SOUTHEAST SULAWESI PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF BUTON REGENCY
NUMBER 6 YEAR 2021
CONCERNING
THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND
CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF BUTON,
Considering : a. that women and children are vulnerable groups who tend to experience acts of torture and violence and therefore must receive protection;
b. that to provide direction, foundation and legal certainty to all parties in the implementation of protection for women and children in Buton Regency, regulation is necessary;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Implementation of Protection for Women and Child Victims of Violence;
In View of 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
